  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you have both your astral arms and visage summoned, you can make the body of your astral self appear (no action required). This spectral body covers you like a suit of armor, joining the arms and visage, with an appearance you choose. While it is present, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Deflect Energy.</strong> When you take Acid, Cold, Fire, Force, Lightning, or Thunder damage, you can take a Reaction to deflect it: the damage is reduced by 1d10 plus your Wisdom modifier (minimum reduction of 1).</p><p><strong>Empowered Arms.</strong> Once on each of your turns when you hit a target with the Arms of the Astral Self, you can deal extra damage to it equal to your Martial Arts die.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
